<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράχλη</span></b> , ἡ, said to
		be 
			Att.
		 form for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράχνη</span>(<i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
			Hellad.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
			<u>Bibl.</u>
			p.533B.
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			823
		</span></i>, but in this passage, as in <i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>HP</u>
			1.5.2
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			1.9.3
		</span></i>, =
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Arbutus Andrachne.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>warming-pan</i> or <i>brazier,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1571.25
			</span></i>, Poet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδραχλος</span></b> , ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράχνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				102.36
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.15.2
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράχνη</span></b> , ἡ, <i>purslane, Portulaca oleracea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.10.4
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.124
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Trag.</u>
				151
			</span></i>, prob.l. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κηπαία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.168
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀγρία,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπλίς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.168
			</span></i>; but =
			<i>Sedum stellatum, stonecrop,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				90
			</span></i>; also=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλέφιον,</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.186
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.146
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θαλασσία,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπλίς</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.168
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδραχνος</span></b> , ἡ, =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὰνδράχλη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.22.2
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				28.1
			</span></i>.</div>
